{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "validationAuthority": "Exported runtime validators; examples are executable inputs, not a second validator.",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "motion.transform",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "motion",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "位移、旋转、尺度与显式枢轴的统一仿射动作",
      "api": "sampleMotion",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "type": "motion.transform",
        "version": 1,
        "range": {
          "start": {
            "n": "0",
            "d": "1"
          },
          "end": {
            "n": "2",
            "d": "1"
          }
        },
        "curve": {
          "type": "smoothstep"
        },
        "params": {
          "from": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "scaleX": 1,
            "scaleY": 1,
            "rotation": 0
          },
          "to": {
            "x": 120,
            "y": 0,
            "scaleX": 1.2,
            "scaleY": 1.2,
            "rotation": 0
          },
          "origin": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "强调位置与尺度关系；旋转单位为弧度"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "不包含透视、skew、任意形变；不要用整体位移冒充角色关节运动"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "motion.opacity",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "motion",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "单元素透明度插值",
      "api": "sampleMotion",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "type": "motion.opacity",
        "version": 1,
        "range": {
          "start": {
            "n": "0",
            "d": "1"
          },
          "end": {
            "n": "2",
            "d": "1"
          }
        },
        "curve": {
          "type": "smoothstep"
        },
        "params": {
          "from": 0,
          "to": 1
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "柔和出现与信息层级"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "不是双场景交叉溶解；重叠透明素材需另行合成设计"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "motion.stagger",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "motion",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "把错峰启动编译为精确绝对区间",
      "api": "compileStagger",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "itemIds": [
          "a",
          "b",
          "c"
        ],
        "start": {
          "n": "0",
          "d": "1"
        },
        "duration": {
          "n": "1",
          "d": "1"
        },
        "step": {
          "n": "1",
          "d": "4"
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "项目列表、卡片或文字块的依次出现"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "不隐式串行等待；每个item时长相同，不是视频剪辑时间线"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "motion.anchored-squash",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "motion",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "锚点保持、面积保持的有限挤压回弹",
      "api": "sampleMotion",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "type": "motion.anchored-squash",
        "version": 1,
        "range": {
          "start": {
            "n": "0",
            "d": "1"
          },
          "end": {
            "n": "2",
            "d": "1"
          }
        },
        "curve": {
          "type": "smoothstep"
        },
        "params": {
          "amount": 0.35,
          "axis": "y",
          "origin": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 50
          }
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "接触地面时保持足底锚点"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "不是软体物理；复杂轮廓局部关节需独立rig"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "motion.shake",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "motion",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "带种子的有限包络抖动",
      "api": "sampleMotion",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "type": "motion.shake",
        "version": 1,
        "range": {
          "start": {
            "n": "0",
            "d": "1"
          },
          "end": {
            "n": "2",
            "d": "1"
          }
        },
        "curve": {
          "type": "smoothstep"
        },
        "params": {
          "amplitudeX": 12,
          "amplitudeY": 6,
          "rotation": 0.03,
          "frequencyHz": 10,
          "seed": "example",
          "elementId": "card"
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "轻微冲击或紧张感；首尾归零"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "不要长时间摇动可读信息；reducedMotion时静态，不用于模拟真实相机物理"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "transition.push",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "transition",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "两个同视口画面互相推移",
      "api": "sampleTransition",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "type": "transition.push",
        "version": 1,
        "range": {
          "start": {
            "n": "0",
            "d": "1"
          },
          "end": {
            "n": "2",
            "d": "1"
          }
        },
        "curve": {
          "type": "smoothstep"
        },
        "params": {
          "width": 640,
          "height": 360,
          "direction": "left"
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "明确方向的空间接力"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "整数viewport、nearest-pixel位移；Canvas父变换必须整数轴对齐；不支持旋转/亚像素父变换无缝合成"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "transition.rect-wipe",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "transition",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "保留A背景、矩形揭示B",
      "api": "sampleTransition",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "type": "transition.rect-wipe",
        "version": 1,
        "range": {
          "start": {
            "n": "0",
            "d": "1"
          },
          "end": {
            "n": "2",
            "d": "1"
          }
        },
        "curve": {
          "type": "smoothstep"
        },
        "params": {
          "width": 640,
          "height": 360,
          "direction": "right"
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "遮罩式层次揭示"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "仅矩形；不做任意path morph，不自动改变两个场景时长或音频"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "composition.offset-cards",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "composition",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "稳定身份的错位卡片布局",
      "api": "offsetCards",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "itemIds": [
          "a",
          "b",
          "c"
        ],
        "origin": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 30
        },
        "card": {
          "width": 160,
          "height": 100
        },
        "offset": {
          "x": 25,
          "y": 15
        },
        "rotationStep": 0.03,
        "zOrder": "ascending"
      },
      "applicability": [
        "错位构图与层叠信息"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "静态layout不隐藏时钟；不得声称避碰/文字排版/任意自适应布局"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "composition.split-panels",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "composition",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "等分面板与明确间距",
      "api": "splitPanels",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "itemIds": [
          "a",
          "b",
          "c"
        ],
        "viewport": {
          "width": 640,
          "height": 360
        },
        "axis": "x",
        "gap": 12
      },
      "applicability": [
        "并排对照、多个视角"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "2到8个等宽或等高面板；不负责内容裁切适配"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "recipe.offset-reassembly",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "recipe",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "错位卡片、错峰、位移尺度与淡入的组合",
      "api": "sampleOffsetReassembly",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "type": "recipe.offset-reassembly",
        "version": 1,
        "range": {
          "start": {
            "n": "0",
            "d": "1"
          },
          "end": {
            "n": "2",
            "d": "1"
          }
        },
        "curve": {
          "type": "smoothstep"
        },
        "params": {
          "itemIds": [
            "a",
            "b",
            "c"
          ],
          "origin": {
            "x": 40,
            "y": 30
          },
          "card": {
            "width": 160,
            "height": 100
          },
          "offset": {
            "x": 25,
            "y": 15
          },
          "rotationStep": 0.03,
          "step": {
            "n": "1",
            "d": "4"
          },
          "travel": {
            "x": -100,
            "y": 80
          }
        }
      },
      "applicability": [
        "从分散进入有序卡片组"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "只组合固定矩形卡片；不是文字碎裂或任意拓扑重组"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "technicalTests": [
          "test/core.test.mjs",
          "test/canvas.test.mjs"
        ],
        "visualDemo": "examples/gallery-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
        "originalProductionTransfer": "NOT_RUN"
      },
      "knowledgeLinks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "geometry.polyline-trail",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "geometry",
      "status": "experimental",
      "summary": "局部弧长折线路径与不超前头部的有界空间拖尾",
      "api": "compilePolyline",
      "entry": "lib/index.mjs",
      "example": {
        "points": [
          {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          {
            "x": 120,
            "y": 0
          },
          {
            "x": 120,
            "y": 80
          }
        ]
      },
      "applicability": [
        "合成节点连线、发射路径、有限空间尾迹"
      ],
      "counterexamples": [
        "不是Bezier或平滑切线",
        "非均匀父scale下不保证屏幕等速",
        "不是历史时间采样或粒子模拟"
      ],
      "evidence": {
        "tests": [
          "test/path.test.mjs"
        ],
        "demo": "examples/path-scene.mjs",
        "artisticReview": "NOT_RUN",
